{a}\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $y\\in \\text{Span}{a}$ and $z⊥\\text{Span}{a},$ as shown in the picture above.\n\nIn conclusion, $z=[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-140117/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "144d1258-f8d5-55e9-be38-ec25b6f84bd3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140117"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-39712"] :question/problem "Let $x=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]$ and $a=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ If $x=y+z,$ where $y\\in \\text{Span}{a}$ and $z⊥\\text{Span}{a},$ then $z=$" :question/worked-solution "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066555/assets/d887852fe51f08cb7296437e69b6a9632721cfd155558e6abf9a99b4f59f7ad6.png)\n\nFirst, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto $\\text{Span}{a}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x & =\\frac{a\\cdot x}{a\\cdot a}a \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 12+6\\cdot 6+(-6)\\cdot (-6)+2\\cdot 12}{{2}^{2}+{6}^{2}+(-6)^{2}+{2}^{2}}a \\\\  & =\\frac{24+36+36+24}{4+36+36+4}a \\\\  & =\\frac{120}{80}a \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}a \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ z & =x-{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $y\\in \\text{Span}{a}$ and $z⊥\\text{Span}{a},$ as shown in the picture above.\n\nIn conclusion, $z=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection/8ef82bd925202f83e0117d843c227d56df66404a95497e855c46ba41e4fde115" :answer/id #uuid "ab2bbbee-db70-5bc9-bb2d-669a368c145a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection/3a1751a5f511a9f493a8e13f8f97bd7ae717c3b674ed63d001c15e221b1c9822" :answer/id #uuid "360fe14b-b8cf-5166-ab3d-44b0b412fb7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection/0f90afda23d0015527b1692cab783180aafc413bac563082e2b8efdf5c91e325" :answer/id #uuid "e5054405-facf-54f5-bdfe-871b9c04b5f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection/719f630fcad83737dfd021895df13748f42b87132e4c962c99d31fa70949a134" :answer/id #uuid "4f5ca75b-30c4-5a20-9400-b0dcb2433959" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection/b1806f6f341029e685996309674f288071202e2e7e7a34d42a6233d417603755" :answer/id #uuid "8b436eb3-bea4-568d-a772-0a7f9c13ed6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86733/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "297cc6f2-9518-5974-8a04-deeb08818110" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-86733/selection/719f630fcad83737dfd021895df13748f42b87132e4c962c99d31fa70949a134" :answer-field/choices ["q-86733/selection/8